  "raw_response": "```python\ndef solve(grid):\n    if not grid:\n        return []\n    n = len(grid)\n    result = [[0 for _ in range(n)] for _ in range(n)]\n    \n    # Generate step lengths: n, n-1, n-1, n-3, n-3, n-5, n-5, ...\n    lengths = [n]\n    i = 1\n    while True:\n        k = (i - 1) // 2\n        length = n - (2 * k + 1)\n        if length <= 0:\n            break\n        lengths.append(length)\n        i += 1\n    \n    # Directions: right, down, left, up\n    directions = [(0, 1), (1, 0), (0, -1), (-1, 0)]\n    r, c = 0, -1\n    dir_idx = 0\n    \n    for length in lengths:\n        dr, dc = directions[dir_idx % 4]\n        for _ in range(length):\n            r += dr\n            c += dc\n            if 0 <= r < n and 0 <= c < n:\n                result[r][c] = 3\n        dir_idx += 1\n    \n    return result\n```",
